## Why This Is Asked
This angle tests privacy-by-design, cross-region data governance, and practical use of Lake Formation with streaming data. It also probes handling of late data, schema evolution, and cost controls under real-world pressure.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant data masking and tokenization strategy
- Lake Formation policy-based access across regions
- Immutable audit trails in DynamoDB and S3 Object Lock
- OpenTelemetry-driven observability
- KMS key management and cross-region replication
- Schema evolution and late-arriving data handling

## Code Example
```javascript
// Lambda masking skeleton
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const masked = maskEventForTenant(event, event.tenantId);
  await writeParquet(masked, `s3://bucket/${event.tenantId}/data/`);
};
```

