## Key Concepts
- Kinesis Data Streams, Lambda/Fargate, Glue Schema Registry, S3, Glue/Athena, DynamoDB, OpenTelemetry
- Schema evolution with backward/forward compatibility; idempotent sinks
- Backpressure handling and 24h backfill
